# {{workspaceName}}

Cloudflare Workers workspace built on [`@system-inc/base-foundation`](https://github.com/system-inc/base).

Workers live under `./workers/<name>/`. Each is independently deployable.

## Develop

```bash
npm install
npm run base -- develop {{workerName}}   # start the dev server
```

Or from inside a worker folder:

```bash
cd workers/{{workerName}} && npx base develop
```

## Test

```bash
npm test                          # unit tests (plain jest)
npm test -- path/to/file          # filter jest by path
npm test -- -t "test name"        # filter by describe/it name

npm run test:integration          # integration tests for every worker
npx base test {{workerName}}      # integration tests for one worker
```

Integration tests need a running worker (`npm run base -- develop {{workerName}}` in another shell). The `base test` command sets up `TEST_WORKER_NAME` and `TEST_HOST` from the worker's `settings.ts`.

## Deploy

```bash
npm run base -- deploy {{workerName}} -e Production
npm run base -- deploy --all-workers -e Production   # deploy everything
```

## Add another worker

```bash
npx base worker create my-new-worker
```

## CLI reference

```bash
npx base --help
```
